OL,3,ATrump waives several Russia sanctions
OL,4,Aas row with Zelensky intensifies
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has used his presidential
OL,7,Fauthority to block numerous sanctions
OL,8,Fon Russia two days before they were due
OL,9,Fto take effect, as a row with his
OL,10,FUkrainian counterpart Volodymyr
OL,11,FZelensky deepens.
OL,13,FThe sanctions were passed by the US
OL,14,FCongress and signed into law by Trump
OL,15,Fin September.
OL,17,FBut the US president issued an
OL,18,Fexecutive order on Friday night saying
OL,19,Fthat withholding some was in the US
OL,20,F"national interest", prompting a
OL,21,Fbacklash from US lawmakers.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
